                <pb facs="0484" n="390" sameAs="frus:frus1924v02/pg390"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.945/1089: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Woods</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-05-16T18:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 16, 1924—6
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>73. The Conference report, in the form indicated in the Department’s 72, May 14,
                    4 p.m., was adopted yesterday in the House, yeas, 308; nays, 62: also in the
                    Senate, yeas, 69; nays, 9.</p>
                <p>Repeat to Peking as Department’s 98.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
